                "text": "On #WorldDayofSocialJustice, I stand committed to building a fairer and more equitable place for all Marylanders. From employment and housing to healthcare and our environment, social justice issues impact millions of Marylanders who deserve equal access and fair treatment. Last year, my Office was granted new authority to enforce civil rights. Our Civil Rights Division is growing quickly to ensure we protect the constitutional rights of all Marylanders because we know that social justice and equality go hand in hand.",
