                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today I announced the conviction of a Frederick County woman who stole $65,000 from a friend\u00a0to pay restitution for an earlier theft conviction. The defendant claimed she needed the money for medical treatment\u2014instead, she used it to pay back the victim of her previous theft scheme.\u00a0We are grateful to our Fraud and Corruption Unit and @MDInsurance for their work on this case. My Office will continue to aggressively prosecute those who abuse trust and engage in financial fraud, regardless of their motivation.\n\nFULL RELEASE: https://t.co/ArkJwec98K",
